erground structures, and retaining walls to provide waterproofing and structural support.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Oil and Gas<\/strong>: As liners for containment structures in oil and gas production, storage, and transportation facilities.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5334\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Geotextile-Cloth-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Geotextile-Cloth-detail1.jpg 1200w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Geotextile-Cloth-detail1-300x157.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Geotextile-Cloth-detail1-1024x536.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Geotextile-Cloth-detail1-768x402.jpg 768w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Geotextile-Cloth-detail1-600x314.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><\/p>\n<h3>Low Temperature Materials<\/h3>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">\n<td width=\"197\" height=\"19\"><strong>Base\u00a0Material<\/strong><\/td>\n<td width=\"415\" height=\"19\"><strong>Application<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"0\">Polyester\u00a0Felt\u00a0 (130\u2109-150\u2109)<\/td>\n<td>Cement Plant,\u00a0Metal Industry,\u00a0Chemical Industry<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Polypropylene\u00a0Felt (90\u2109-120\u2109)<\/td>\n<td>Metal Industry,\u00a0Chemical Industry<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>High Temperature Materials<\/h3>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">\n<td width=\"197\" height=\"19\"><strong>Base\u00a0Material<\/strong><\/td>\n<td width=\"362\" height=\"19\"><strong>Application<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"0\" height=\"0\">P84\u00a0Felt\u00a0 (260\u2109-280\u2109)<\/td